3: Course `english-language-development-grades-9-to-12` (catalog id `eld-9-12`), grades 9, 10, 11 and 12, a band
4: course of four grade years. Draft frame, written 2026-11-25 on the shape of the English language development pilot
5: frame (grades K to 2); the scope and sequence sets the days later, one year at a time. Each year's part of this file
6: (its units, its end-of-unit assessments, its two course-level checks) is that grade year's frame, which meets
7: STANDARD.md section 2 ("one frame per grade year").
