242: 
243: ### Where the threads end
244: 
245: Grade 12 is the last ELD year. Every content thread ends in the owner year's unit (28 to 36), checked by a task the
246: student does alone at levels 3 and 4 from the model with no sentence frame (the row notes' grade 12 withdrawal).
247: The four SI threads end here too, carried since their owner year, grade 4. The school's own exit score, not this
248: course, decides when a student leaves English learner status.
249: 
