| g11-ss-explain (unit 23) | g12-ss-explain | 29 | Owner year: a complex system with weighted causes (checks and balances) |
| g11-sc-explain (unit 21) | g12-sc-explain | 30 | Owner year: a complex system with weighted, multi-factor causes |
| g11-ma-explain (unit 26); g11-si-explain (unit 23) | g12-ma-explain; g12-si-explain | 31 | Owner year: a method explained from goal to conclusion; a plan statement spoken and then written |
| g11-ss-argue (unit 24); g11-si-argue (unit 22) | g12-ss-argue; g12-si-argue | 32 | Owner year: a policy argument with concession, rebuttal and limits; leading a discussion and holding a claim |
